OL,3,GNEWSARifle range approved despite
OL,4,ABuddhist monastery opposition
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a rifle range in the hills of
OL,7,Fsouthern Scotland have been approved
OL,8,Fdespite fears it could disturb the
OL,9,F"quiet and seclusion" enjoyed by a
OL,10,Fnearby Buddhist monastery.
OL,12,FThe Rokpa Trust - which runs the Samye
OL,13,FLing Tibetan Centre at Eskdalemuir -
OL,14,Fasked for the plans at Over Cassock to
OL,15,Fbe rejected.
OL,17,FCouncillors were told the site was
OL,18,Fabout three miles (5km) from the
OL,19,Fmonastery and that the majority of
OL,20,Fletters of support for the plans came
OL,21,Ffrom outside the area.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
